{"page":505,"blocks":[{"x":0.56907,"y":0.05257,"w":0.38244,"h":0.01535,"fs":0.01535,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"8.6 Integral Tables and Computer Algebra Systems 491"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.093,"w":0.17241,"h":0.01375,"fs":0.01375,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Integration with a CAS"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.11766,"w":0.59303,"h":0.04348,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":1,"t":"A powerful capability of computer algebra systems is their ability to integrate symboli- cally. This is performed with the integrate command specified by the particular system (for example, int in Maple, Integrate in Mathematica)."},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.18502,"w":0.58899,"h":0.01449,"fs":0.01407,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"EXAMPLE 5 Suppose that you want to evaluate the indefinite integral of the function"},{"x":0.58887,"y":0.2029,"w":0.13636,"h":0.01795,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"ƒ(x) = x22a2 + x2."},{"x":0.36259,"y":0.22939,"w":0.33693,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Using Maple, you first define or name the function:"},{"x":0.55963,"y":0.2422,"w":0.20224,"h":0.02131,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"7 ƒJ x¿2 * sqrt (a¿2 + x¿2);"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.27206,"w":0.53206,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Then you use the integrate command on ƒ, identifying the variable of integration:"},{"x":0.62354,"y":0.29271,"w":0.07442,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"7 int(ƒ, x);"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.31473,"w":0.16582,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Maple returns the answer"},{"x":0.44931,"y":0.32918,"w":0.41557,"h":0.03583,"fs":0.01441,"n":4,"k":0,"t":"1 4 x(a2 + x2)3>2 - 1 8 a2x2a2 + x2 - 1 8 a4 ln 1x + 2a2 + x22."},{"x":0.36259,"y":0.37402,"w":0.36296,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"If you want to see if the answer can be simplified, enter"},{"x":0.60852,"y":0.39468,"w":0.10445,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"7 simplify(,);"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.41669,"w":0.09132,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Maple returns"},{"x":0.45116,"y":0.43114,"w":0.41186,"h":0.03583,"fs":0.01441,"n":4,"k":0,"t":"1 8 a2x2a2 + x2 + 1 4 x32a2 + x2 - 1 8 a4 ln 1x + 2a2 + x22."},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.46555,"w":0.48805,"h":0.02323,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"If you want the definite integral for 0 … x … p>2, you can use the format"},{"x":0.58786,"y":0.48688,"w":0.14578,"h":0.02323,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"7 int(ƒ, x = 0..Pi>2);"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.51866,"w":0.21239,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Maple will return the expression"},{"x":0.47176,"y":0.54042,"w":0.37065,"h":0.0286,"fs":0.01279,"n":4,"k":0,"t":"1 64 p(4a2 + p2)(3>2) - 1 32 a2p24a2 + p2 + 1 8 a4 ln (2)"},{"x":0.52336,"y":0.56508,"w":0.29182,"h":0.03591,"fs":0.01441,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"8 a4 ln 1p + 24a2 + p22 + 1 16 a4 ln (a2)."},{"x":0.50628,"y":0.57388,"w":0.02526,"h":0.01982,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"- 1"},{"x":0.36259,"y":0.60991,"w":0.50301,"h":0.01281,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"You can also find the definite integral for a particular value of the constant a:"},{"x":0.59815,"y":0.63058,"w":0.12537,"h":0.03266,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"7 aJ 1; 7 int(ƒ, x = 0..1);"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.67178,"w":0.23533,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Maple returns the numerical answer"},{"x":0.57613,"y":0.68623,"w":0.16193,"h":0.03575,"fs":0.01441,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"3 822 + 1 8 ln1 22 - 12."},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.74001,"w":0.24136,"h":0.01449,"fs":0.01407,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"EXAMPLE 6 Use a CAS to find"},{"x":0.61495,"y":0.76751,"w":0.10187,"h":0.01728,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"sin2 x cos3 x dx."},{"x":0.36259,"y":0.80567,"w":0.27685,"h":0.01365,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"Solution With Maple, we have the entry"},{"x":0.55317,"y":0.81934,"w":0.21517,"h":0.02131,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"7 int ((sin¿2)(x) * (cos¿3)(x), x);"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.8492,"w":0.16948,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"with the immediate return"},{"x":0.48771,"y":0.87245,"w":0.01954,"h":0.01914,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"-1"},{"x":0.49907,"y":0.87245,"w":0.32731,"h":0.02719,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":1,"t":"5 sin(x) cos(x)4